      <elementName>Text</elementName>
      <elementAttributes>
        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>P58 Branch predictor (2-bit counters) - Digital task
4 counters of 2 bits, the prediction multiplexer and a correct-count.
Allowed parts: all of the above + Add, Sub, Comparator, Neg
Do not rename, move or delete the input and output pins.</string>
